Source: discourse-jemalloc
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Discourse Team <team@discourse.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jemalloc/jemalloc

Package: libjemalloc1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: jemalloc 3.6 allocator for Discourse Ruby processes
 This package contains the pinned jemalloc ABI used as Discourse's Ruby
 allocator. It is intentionally co-installable with Debian's libjemalloc2.
